  partName: Mounting Bolt
  description: The Mounting Bolt is a complex-shaped, tiny fastener situated at the
    top-right-center of the engine, responsible for securing the engine to its mounts
    or other components. Fabricated from Material.001, it withstands significant
    stresses and vibrations. Notably, its complex shape enables it to distribute
    loads evenly, ensuring a stable engine mounting system.
